## 📋 Project Overview

This repository contains the complete **black-box penetration testing assessment** of Mediroza General Hospital's web infrastructure. Over a five-day engagement, a comprehensive security evaluation was conducted to identify vulnerabilities, extract sensitive data, and demonstrate real-world attack impact.

### Key Results

| Milestone | Objective | Status |
|---|---|---|
| **M1** | Attack website & retrieve 3 patient PDFs | ✅ **Complete** |
| **M2** | Crack encryption on all 3 PDFs | ✅ **Complete** |
| **M3** | Find staff salaries & shareholder details | ✅ **Complete** |
| **M4** | Professional pentest report | ✅ **Complete** |

---

